      "content": "it's not just sadness though. it's like i've been hollowed out. i've spent my whole life trying to pour something meaningful into the world, but the well is just... gone. it feels like i'm just occupying space that belongs to someone who actually has something to say. it's exhausting, pretending to be a person when there's nothing left.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
